<title>USA: School Dist #1, Minn., balance at $17.45 mln.</title>
<headline>School Dist #1, Minn., balance at $17.45 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane Corp said it had a $17.45 million balance on a $47 million of Special School District No. 1, Minn., general obligation school building bonds of 1996, won with a true interest cost of 5.149 percent.</p>
<p>		     Balance</p>
<p>			Amount	  Coupon	  Price</p>
<p>Maturity	     (million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
